OL,4,BRegulator chief 'has stomach' to face  
OL,5,BMan City                               
OL,6,GThe chair of English football's        
OL,7,Gindependent regulator has told MPs he  
OL,8,G"has the stomach" to take potential    
OL,9,Gaction against Manchester City.        
OL,11,FThe club was found guilty of breaching 
OL,12,FPremier League financial rules over a  
OL,13,Fnine-season period by an independent   
OL,14,Fcommission.                            
